<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.35 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.35 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Statistics Office released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES * Aug	  July	 Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1990)	 116.50	 n/a	  n/a</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	 0.10	 0.04	 n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	   1.35	 1.37	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * prices as measured on the first of the following month.</p>
<p>Statec said price rises were mainly seen for housing, heating and lighting, furniture and moving equipment, and transport and communication. For clothing and shoes lower prices were recorded.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
